Include paths whose letter case does not match the file on disk
(Dolphin/ vs dolphin/, KartCtrl.h vs kartCtrl.h, JAUdio vs JAudio, ...).
MWCC runs on a case-insensitive view of the tree; the host compiler sees
the real, case-sensitive file system.

